{"version":1,"content":"<p>受來自印尼山火引致的霧霾影響，新加坡近幾周的空氣質素持續欠佳。</p><p>新加坡衛生部周一（12日）啟動「公共衛生防護診所計劃」及「煙霾津貼計劃」（HSS），協助當地公民應對因霧霾引起的相關健康問題，是11年來首次。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:56.072265+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T06:55:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:17:40.946937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:42.170959+00:00","content_hash":"04ef256fd3da0cd31f92b1f846c11ca51b6fdb00fe538a8b520556c584bf229b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}